# The C4 screens: `monkeyc -f "monkey.jungle;shots.jungle"`, only through `tools/sim.py shots`.
# It is the demo (`demo.jungle`) without `DemoHold`: it swaps the `demoAfterLoad` that holds the screen
# (`demo/source/DemoHold.mc`, annotated `demo_hold`) for the one in `demo/shots/ShotStart.mc`, which puts the
# motorcycle at 3 points of the SP route (far, near, arrival) and tells `sim.py`, which photographs the
# simulator. `bin/shots/ShotParams.mc` is generated by `sim.py` on every run, from `tokens.json`.
base.sourcePath = source;demo/source;demo/shots;bin/shots
base.resourcePath = resources;demo/resources
base.excludeAnnotations = canary;quadratic_parse;nodemo;demo_hold;no_near_alert
